=> This covers: Search, availability check, booking, concurrency, and cancellation.

C. 6 MANDATORY STEPS FOR LLD DESIGN

1. Clarify requirements

=> Functional: Search restaurants, view tables/slots, make/cancel reservation, manage tables (admin).
=> Non-Functional: Fast availability check, concurrency safety.
=> Assumptions: Simple time slots, single city for LLD.
=> Edge Cases: Double booking, cancellation policy, no tables available.

2. Identify entities and relationships

=> Main entities : Restaurant, Table, Reservation, User, TimeSlot
=> Key relationships :
Restaurant has multiple Tables.
Table has multiple TimeSlots.
Reservation links User + Table + TimeSlot.

